<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Rallarveien: Riksgränsen/Bjørnfjell–Rombaksbotn — Riksgränsen full crossing to Rombaksbotn [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>Walk the full Riksgränsen crossing from the Riksgränsvägen–Rallarvägen walking junction to the Rombaksbotn pier approach: approximately 17.2 km and about six hours. Bjørnfjell is a practical shorter start, not this default course. Approximate terrain-derived ascent is 270 m and descent 780 m, with uncertainty around 100 m or more. The historical terrain source dates to 2013, with a January 2018 tile-feed update; foreign-side terrain quality is uncertain. Ground modelling, including at bridges and tunnels, is not an operator measurement, field survey or walking elevation profile. Prepare for cold, fog, wind, snow or ice and wet rough ground on this high-country historic road. Check local conditions and obey restrictions; source capture is not an all-open guarantee. Recorded bridges/tunnel, two fords and a lift gate require careful assessment on the ground; water levels and gate conditions are not established by mapping. Cross the railway only at the designated walking crossing, heed trains and signals, and never walk on railway tracks. Arrange and confirm the roadless Rombaksbotn return before departure. Published July–mid-September boat/bus arrangements do not establish October service. OSM source edits span 2012–2026. The planning line is not a field inspection or navigation-grade track.

Route geometry © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright and https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Changes: whole original source ways ordered into the walking itinerary; canonical display uses only selected original vertices. No elevation assigned. Terrain metric facts © Kartverket — https://www.kartverket.no/; DTM10UTM33 dataset dddbb667-1303-4ac5-8640-7ec04c0e3918, https://www.geonorge.no/geonetwork/srv/api/records/dddbb667-1303-4ac5-8640-7ec04c0e3918/formatters/xml, CC BY 4.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Actual processed API source https://hoydedata.no/arcgis/rest/services/NHM_DTM_25833/ImageServer/getSamples, locked raster 2212 (7506_4_10m_z33), 10 m NN2000; all 883 vertices/882 edges sampled privately at &lt;=10 m, provider bilinear interpolation, centered25m mean preserving endpoints, rounded10m. 0/50/100m smoothing sensitivity retained privately. Terrain contributes facts only, not walking geometry or public heights.

